msgid "3. Forms, Pickers, & Controlled Inputs"
msgstr "3. 表单输入、选择器与受控状态"

#: ../../source/declarative/inputs.rst:4
msgid ""
"In declarative Xent, form controls receive their current value from "
"``Model`` in ``view()`` and emit user changes back to ``update()`` via "
"``XtkMsg`` payloads."
msgstr "在声明式 Xent 中，表单控件在 ``view()`` 里从 ``Model`` 读取当前值，并通过 ``XtkMsg`` 载荷将用户的修改传回 ``update()`` 。"

