#: ../../source/declarative/inputs.rst:59
msgid "Buttons, Links, and Menu Variants"
msgstr "按钮、超链接与下拉菜单按钮"

#: ../../source/declarative/inputs.rst:61
msgid ""
"**Standard & styled buttons** (``&flux_ctrl_button``): ``xtk_button`` "
"supports ``XTK_BUTTON_STANDARD`` (``0``), ``XTK_BUTTON_ACCENT``, "
"``XTK_BUTTON_SUBTLE``, and ``XTK_BUTTON_TEXT``, plus named Fluent icons "
"in ``.icon`` (such as ``\"Save\"``, ``\"Share\"``, ``\"Delete\"``, "
"``\"Settings\"``; pass ``NULL`` as the label for an icon-only button)."
msgstr ""
"**标准与样式按钮** （ ``&flux_ctrl_button`` ）： ``xtk_button`` 支持 ``XTK_BUTTON_STANDARD`` （ ``0`` ）、 "
"``XTK_BUTTON_ACCENT`` 、 ``XTK_BUTTON_SUBTLE`` 与 ``XTK_BUTTON_TEXT`` 四种样式，并可在 ``.icon`` 中填写 "
"Fluent 图标名（如 ``\"Save\"`` 、 ``\"Share\"`` 、 ``\"Delete\"`` 、 ``\"Settings\"`` ；将标签设为 ``NULL`` 即为纯图标按钮）。"

#: ../../source/declarative/inputs.rst:66
msgid ""
"**Repeat button & Hyperlink**: ``xtk_repeat`` (``&flux_ctrl_repeat``) "
"fires ``.click`` repeatedly while held down; ``xtk_link`` "
"(``&flux_ctrl_link``) opens ``.url`` or posts ``.click``."
msgstr ""
"**连发按钮与超链接** ： ``xtk_repeat`` （ ``&flux_ctrl_repeat`` ）在按住期间连续触发 ``.click`` ； "
"``xtk_link`` （ ``&flux_ctrl_link`` ）可打开 ``.url`` 链接或发送 ``.click`` 消息。"

#: ../../source/declarative/inputs.rst:69
msgid ""
"**Dropdown, Split, & ToggleSplit buttons** (``&flux_ctrl_dropdown``, "
"``&flux_ctrl_split``, ``&flux_ctrl_togglesplit``): Attach a popup menu "
"array of ``XtkMenuItemDesc`` items:"
msgstr ""
"**下拉、拆分与切换拆分按钮** （ ``&flux_ctrl_dropdown`` 、 ``&flux_ctrl_split`` 、 "
"``&flux_ctrl_togglesplit`` ）：通过 ``XtkMenuItemDesc`` 数组挂载弹出菜单："

#: ../../source/declarative/inputs.rst:88
msgid "Toggles, Radio Groups, and Numeric Controls"
msgstr "开关、单选按钮组与数值控件"

#: ../../source/declarative/inputs.rst:131
msgid ""
"Remember to register each corresponding module (``&flux_ctrl_checkbox``, "
"``&flux_ctrl_switch``, ``&flux_ctrl_radiogroup``, ``&flux_ctrl_number``, "
"``&flux_ctrl_slider``) or call ``flux_controls_all()``."
msgstr ""
"记得注册对应的控件模块（ ``&flux_ctrl_checkbox`` 、 ``&flux_ctrl_switch`` 、 ``&flux_ctrl_radiogroup`` 、 "
"``&flux_ctrl_number`` 、 ``&flux_ctrl_slider`` ），或直接调用 ``flux_controls_all()`` 。"

#: ../../source/declarative/inputs.rst:136
msgid "Controlled Text Editing & ``AutoSuggestBox``"
msgstr "受控文本编辑与 ``AutoSuggestBox``"

#: ../../source/declarative/inputs.rst:138
msgid ""
"``xtk_textbox`` (``&flux_ctrl_textbox``) and ``xtk_password`` "
"(``&flux_ctrl_password``) support full DirectWrite grapheme navigation, "
"undo/redo, clipboard shortcuts, and CJK IME composition."
msgstr ""
"``xtk_textbox`` （ ``&flux_ctrl_textbox`` ）与 ``xtk_password`` （ ``&flux_ctrl_password`` ）"
"内置完整的 DirectWrite 字素光标移动、撤销/重做、剪贴板快捷键与中日韩输入法（IME）组字支持。"

#: ../../source/declarative/inputs.rst:142
msgid ""
"Because ``msg.ptr`` is borrowed only until ``update()`` returns, copy the"
" UTF-8 string into heap or fixed buffer storage owned by ``Model``:"
msgstr "``msg.ptr`` 仅在 ``update()`` 执行期间借用有效，请将其拷贝到由 ``Model`` 持有的堆内存或固定缓冲区中："

#: ../../source/declarative/inputs.rst:177
msgid ""
"The Fluxent host tracks per-source ``XtkChangeStamp`` revisions "
"automatically: passing ``m->query`` back through ``.content`` updates the"
" control cleanly on external resets while preserving active IME "
"composition and cursor selection during live typing."
msgstr ""
"Fluxent 宿主会自动追踪各变更源的 ``XtkChangeStamp`` 版本戳：把 ``m->query`` 传回 ``.content`` "
"既能让外部重置立即生效，又能在用户连续打字时完好保留正在进行的输入法组字状态与光标选区。"

#: ../../source/declarative/inputs.rst:182
msgid ""
"For multi-line editors or read-only text views, set ``.multiline = true``"
" and/or ``.readonly = true`` on ``XtkTextBoxDesc``."
msgstr "需要多行文本编辑或只读文本框时，在 ``XtkTextBoxDesc`` 上设置 ``.multiline = true`` 或 ``.readonly = true`` 。"

#: ../../source/declarative/inputs.rst:186
msgid "ComboBox, Date, Time, Calendar, & Color Pickers"
msgstr "下拉框、日期、时间、日历与颜色选择器"

#: ../../source/declarative/inputs.rst:188
msgid ""
"**ComboBox** (``xtk_combo``, ``&flux_ctrl_combo``): Pass ``char const "
"*const *`` strings in ``.items``, ``.nitem``, and ``.sel``. Set "
"``.editable = true`` with ``.submit = xtk_msg(MSG_CUSTOM_VALUE)`` to "
"allow free-form text entry in addition to preset choices."
msgstr ""
"**ComboBox 下拉框** （ ``xtk_combo`` ， ``&flux_ctrl_combo`` ）：通过 ``.items`` 、 ``.nitem`` 与 ``.sel`` "
"传入选项列表和当前索引；设置 ``.editable = true`` 并绑定 ``.submit = xtk_msg(MSG_CUSTOM_VALUE)`` 可同时支持自由输入文本。"

#: ../../source/declarative/inputs.rst:192
msgid ""
"**Date & Calendar** (``xtk_date_picker`` / ``xtk_calendar_view``): Dates "
"are encoded as ``int32_t`` values via ``xtk_date(year, month, day)`` "
"(``year * 10000 + month * 100 + day``, such as ``20261118``). Decode in "
"``update()`` with ``year = d / 10000``, ``month = (d / 100) % 100``, "
"``day = d % 100``."
msgstr ""
"**日期与日历** （ ``xtk_date_picker`` / ``xtk_calendar_view`` ）：日期使用 ``xtk_date(year, month, day)`` "
"编码为 ``int32_t`` 整数（ ``year * 10000 + month * 100 + day`` ，例如 ``20261118`` ）；"
"在 ``update()`` 中通过 ``year = d / 10000`` 、 ``month = (d / 100) % 100`` 、 ``day = d % 100`` 解码。"

#: ../../source/declarative/inputs.rst:197
msgid ""
"**TimePicker** (``xtk_time_picker``): ``.minutes`` stores minutes since "
"``00:00`` (``hours * 60 + mins``), with ``.has_time = true`` and ``.clock"
" = XTK_CLOCK_24H`` or ``XTK_CLOCK_12H``."
msgstr ""
"**时间选择器** （ ``xtk_time_picker`` ）： ``.minutes`` 保存自 ``00:00`` 起的分钟数（ ``hours * 60 + mins`` ），"
"配合 ``.has_time = true`` 与 ``.clock = XTK_CLOCK_24H`` 或 ``XTK_CLOCK_12H`` 使用。"

#: ../../source/declarative/inputs.rst:200
msgid ""
"**ColorPicker** (``xtk_color_picker``): Takes an ``XtkColor`` in "
"``.color``, optional ``.alpha = true`` channel slider, and ``.spectrum`` "
"layout, posting packed 32-bit ARGB integers to ``msg.i``."
msgstr ""
"**颜色选择器** （ ``xtk_color_picker`` ）：通过 ``.color`` 传入 ``XtkColor`` ，支持 ``.alpha = true`` "
"透明通道滑块与 ``.spectrum`` 色谱形状，并在变更时将 32 位 ARGB 整数写入 ``msg.i`` 。"
